      "content": "friends and talking to people... thats the whole reason i left. everyone just expects stuff from you. they want you to be a certain way or be \"present\". if i try to reach out, i'm just letting the world back in and i know it'll just be more noise and more pain. i just want the noise to stop. i want to be still, but i can't be still in this life.",
